{"id":2490,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为深化课程数字化教学改革，推进教学质量持续提升，3月10日下午，算法分析与设计课程组在软件实验大楼523会议室召开教学专题研讨会。学院教学指导委员会专家杨晓文老师莅临指导，课程组教师靳雁霞、师智斌、于海波、贾彩琴、王梦丽参会。</p><p>会议紧扣“数字化教材落地应用”这一核心议题，重点聚焦课程内容与作业体系的协同建设。课程组充分结合数字化教材的资源优势与学生认知特点，提出将配套教学视频、章节测试等数字资源与课堂教学深度结合，采用“线上预习+线下精讲+作业实践”的混合式教学模式，引导学生主动探究算法设计与优化技巧，培养计算思维。</p><p>此次教研活动进一步明确了数字化教材背景下课程教学的优化方向，凝聚了教学改革共识。课程组将以此次研讨为契机，稳步推进教学创新，持续完善教学体系，助力学院人才培养质量再上新台阶。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RnlL7sn7Q2nzL4MV7L8U4GDU4LZo7r22oRVRM87sU462LmU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyiMSh7USybUNQVLNLYnNUZUNLaolWVMRLPM4M7ozCPnlMFU4WRMlC8LRfFLzl8o7lJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLz-0LzGbL4LJqddnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1112&nid=10933&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C55DA9BFE2C2FD8BC09BE43173D961EC/C2C5F400/1548E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RLzn77LNrVUzCZUVz94UmnfnllPL8r2Ro7rVM4LsnmUsUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRoSyPUSyDL7L4LNUDU8-4M4QfLl7bL4V2MRvYU8-bLlMFL4Gsozvin7nFnRlDL8lJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLz-0LzGbL4LJqddnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1112&nid=10933&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Rn7L7YL4l8MzLDLV8-ZnRLaLRUZMmv2ZLmGbLN7DMR7sUm70gihFp2hmCIa0n1hfLYy8USyZMmrkUN-4nm-8Um7bLzA2olV7nmCaLNCDnNQFLzNiLlLYM4MFLzv8Uz9Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLz-0LzGbL4LJqddnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1112&nid=10933&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FA34A865BBB3F24B1918F9ADF602F6FF/1951C273/174A8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RnlV7VL7UZoz-4MVRQ7UmLbMzUiU8M2Vo7UinRQVU8UDLR-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyDokh7n1hkLRA7Lm7YUzAkMlM7LlLaLNlYMzLinRM7ozrFMzLPLz94U8QFn7QfM4-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLz-0LzGbL4LJqddnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1112&nid=10933&e=.png\"></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RnlL7sn7Q2nzL4MV7L8U4GDU4LZo7r22oRVRM87sU462LmU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyiMSh7USybUNQVLNLYnNUZUNLaolWVMRLPM4M7ozCPnlMFU4WRMlC8LRfFLzl8o7lJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLz-0LzGbL4LJqddnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1112&nid=10933&e=.png"}